{"id":"923d91c3e419d09b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-infinjury.md","title":"具有无限损伤的阶段记录","display":"df-infinjury — 具有无限损伤的阶段记录","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-infinjury","aliases":["20-df-infinjury"],"display":"df-infinjury — 具有无限损伤的阶段记录","chapter":"7","section":"7.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§7.1 finite/infinite injury 的讨论","source_pdf_pages":[181],"source_printed_pages":[147],"depends_on":["[[20-df-priority]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-infinjury"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-infinjury</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinjury — 具有无限损伤的阶段记录"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§7.1 finite/infinite injury 的讨论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>181</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>147</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}infinjury}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasInfiniteInjury}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\omega\\ [|I_i(C)|=\\omega].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}infinjury}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasInfiniteInjury}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\omega\\ [|I_i(C)|=\\omega].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是损伤记录的性质，不是“无限损伤方法”的完整定义。本书指出其进一步证明需要真阶段、优先树等机制；旧稿仅写无限损伤次数，现明确其限度，避免推导任意构造的正确性。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.1 finite/infinite injury 的讨论；印刷页 147；PDF 第 181 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-priority]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}infinjury}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasInfiniteInjury}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\omega\\ [|I_i(C)|=\\omega].","display":true}],"bytes":1145,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["116befd67ce6228f"]}